WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.087
Welcome to the Federal Modernization
Workbook's developer workbook,

2
00:00:04.087 --> 00:00:05.688
Building Provider Notices.

3
00:00:05.688 --> 00:00:10.000
This is Chapter 3: Oracle Cloud
Infrastructure announcements.

4
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:13.836
When a platform the agency doesn't
run is patched on a Saturday night,

5
00:00:13.836 --> 00:00:16.849
the people who own what runs
on it should hear from the

6
00:00:16.849 --> 00:00:19.863
provider's own record, not
from the help desk on Monday.

7
00:00:19.863 --> 00:00:24.774
We'll start from what Oracle's documentation
gives you, see what it leaves to you,

8
00:00:24.774 --> 00:00:27.117
then read how the kit fills the record,

9
00:00:27.117 --> 00:00:29.988
and walk two labs, the
evidence and the dangers.

10
00:00:29.988 --> 00:00:31.563
Two notes before we begin.

11
00:00:31.563 --> 00:00:34.924
This chapter is a draft,
awaiting the owner's review.

12
00:00:34.924 --> 00:00:38.520
And the code is illustrative,
tested against fixtures.
